{"seq":1,"slug":"drawing-context","title":"绘图上下文与状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/canvas2d/drawing-context","wordCount":1517,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"绘图上下文与状态机\">绘图上下文与状态机</h1><p>新手写 Canvas 最常见的困惑是：「我明明只想给这一个矩形加半透明，怎么后面所有东西都变透明了？」根源在于他们把 <code>ctx</code> 当成了一堆无状态的绘图函数，而它其实是一台<strong>有记忆的状态机</strong>。你调用的每一个方法要么在读这台机器当前的状态，要么在悄悄改写它。抓住「状态机」这个心智模型，Canvas 2D 的一切怪异行为都会变得可预测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一台带状态栈的绘图机器\">核心概念：一台带状态栈的绘图机器</h2><p><code>canvas.getContext(&#39;2d&#39;)</code> 返回的 <code>CanvasRenderingContext2D</code> 对象，内部维护着一组<strong>当前绘图状态</strong>：填充色、描边色、线宽、字体、透明度、合成模式、裁剪区域，以及最关键的——一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>变换矩阵</strong>。任何一次 <code>fill()</code>/<code>stroke()</code>/<code>drawImage()</code> 都会读取这些状态来决定「怎么画」。</p>\n<p>这台机器还带一个<strong>状态栈</strong>：<code>save()</code> 把当前全部状态压栈，<code>restore()</code> 弹栈还原。这对方法是写出可维护 Canvas 代码的命脉——它让你可以「临时改状态、画完还原」，避免状态污染后续绘制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[getContext 2d] --&gt; B[当前绘图状态&lt;br/&gt;fillStyle/lineWidth/alpha/变换矩阵/裁剪]&#10;  B --&gt; C{save 压栈}&#10;  C --&gt; D[状态栈: 保存快照]&#10;  B --&gt; E[改状态并绘制]&#10;  E --&gt; F{restore 弹栈}&#10;  F --&gt; B&#10;  D --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[getContext 2d] --&gt; B[当前绘图状态&lt;br/&gt;fillStyle/lineWidth/alpha/变换矩阵/裁剪]\n  B --&gt; C{save 压栈}\n  C --&gt; D[状态栈: 保存快照]\n  B --&gt; E[改状态并绘制]\n  E --&gt; F{restore 弹栈}\n  F --&gt; B\n  D --&gt; F</pre><p>理解这台机器有两条铁律。第一，<strong>状态是持续生效的</strong>：你设了 <code>ctx.globalAlpha = 0.5</code>，之后每一笔都是半透明，直到你显式改回或 <code>restore</code>。第二，<strong>绘制指令本身不改状态</strong>：<code>fillRect</code> 会画，但不会改 <code>fillStyle</code>；真正改状态的是那些赋值和 <code>translate</code>/<code>scale</code>/<code>rotate</code> 这类变换调用。这也解释了开头的困惑——那位新手改了 <code>globalAlpha</code> 却没有用 <code>save</code>/<code>restore</code> 包起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态栈-save-与-restore-的正确姿势\">状态栈：save 与 restore 的正确姿势</h2><p><code>save</code>/<code>restore</code> 必须成对出现，且严格后进先出。一个稳健的习惯是：<strong>任何需要临时改变状态的绘制，都用 save/restore 包裹成一个「作用域」</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function drawHighlight(ctx, x, y, w, h) {&#10;  ctx.save(); // 进入作用域，保存现场&#10;  ctx.globalAlpha = 0.4;&#10;  ctx.fillStyle = &#39;#f5a623&#39;;&#10;  ctx.translate(x, y);&#10;  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);&#10;  ctx.restore(); // 退出作用域，还原一切&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> drawHighlight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 进入作用域，保存现场</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.globalAlpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.fillStyle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '#f5a623'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">translate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, y);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fillRect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, w, h);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">restore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 退出作用域，还原一切</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>restore</code> 会一次性还原<strong>所有</strong>被 <code>save</code> 快照的状态，包括变换矩阵和裁剪区域,这是它比手动逐项还原可靠得多的原因——你几乎不可能记全所有改过的状态项。注意 save/restore 有轻微开销，在每帧上万次绘制的热路径里要衡量频率；但在绝大多数场景里，为了正确性成对使用它永远是对的默认选择。</p>\n<p>下面这张表把最常被误用的状态项列出来，标明它们是否会被 save/restore 覆盖：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态项</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th align=\"center\">受 save/restore 管理</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>fillStyle</code> / <code>strokeStyle</code></td>\n<td>填充/描边样式</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>忘了改回，污染后续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>globalAlpha</code></td>\n<td>全局透明度</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>不还原导致全屏变淡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>globalCompositeOperation</code></td>\n<td>合成模式</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>设了 <code>lighter</code> 忘还原</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lineWidth</code> / <code>lineJoin</code></td>\n<td>描边几何</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>变换后线宽被缩放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变换矩阵</td>\n<td>坐标映射</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>累积 translate 不还原</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>裁剪区域</td>\n<td>绘制蒙版</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>只能靠 restore 撤销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当前路径</td>\n<td>正在构建的路径</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>否</strong></td>\n<td>误以为 restore 能清路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是关键陷阱：<strong>当前路径不属于绘图状态</strong>，<code>restore</code> 不会清空它，清路径要用 <code>beginPath()</code>。这个区分是下一篇 <a href=\"paths-shapes\">路径与形状</a> 的核心，本文只作提醒。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变换矩阵-坐标系是可以移动的\">变换矩阵：坐标系是可以移动的</h2><p>Canvas 的坐标默认以画布左上角为原点、y 轴向下。但你几乎不该用绝对坐标去画每个图元——那样代码里全是硬编码的加加减减。正确做法是<strong>移动坐标系本身</strong>：用 <code>translate</code> 把原点搬到图元该在的地方，再在局部坐标里画。</p>\n<p>变换本质是对每个点左乘一个矩阵。平移、缩放、旋转对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 齐次矩阵分别是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=\\begin{bmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;t_x\\\\0&amp;1&amp;t_y\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad\nS=\\begin{bmatrix}s_x&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;s_y&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad\nR=\\begin{bmatrix}\\cos\\theta&amp;-\\sin\\theta&amp;0\\\\\\sin\\theta&amp;\\cos\\theta&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{bmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.667em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 3600\"><path d=\"M403 1759 V84 H666 V0 H319 V1759 v0 v1759 h347 v-84\nH403z M403 1759 V0 H319 V1759 v0 v1759 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.667em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 3600\"><path d=\"M347 1759 V0 H0 V84 H263 V1759 v0 v1759 H0 v84 H347z\nM347 1759 V0 H263 V1759 v0 v1759 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"