t:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 3600\"><path d=\"M403 1759 V84 H666 V0 H319 V1759 v0 v1759 h347 v-84\nH403z M403 1759 V0 H319 V1759 v0 v1759 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.667em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 3600\"><path d=\"M347 1759 V0 H0 V84 H263 V1759 v0 v1759 H0 v84 H347z\nM347 1759 V0 H263 V1759 v0 v1759 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>连续调用 <code>translate</code>、<code>rotate</code>、<code>scale</code> 等价于把这些矩阵依次右乘到当前矩阵上，所以<strong>变换是累积的、且顺序敏感</strong>：先平移后旋转，和先旋转后平移，结果完全不同。这也是为什么变换必须配合 save/restore——否则每帧累积的 translate 会让画面「漂走」。你可以用 <code>setTransform(a,b,c,d,e,f)</code> 直接覆盖整个矩阵，或 <code>resetTransform()</code> 复位为单位矩阵。齐次坐标与矩阵的数学，在 WebGL 里会以同样的形式再次出现，见 <a href=\"../webgl/rendering-pipeline\">渲染管线</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"透明度与合成模式\">透明度与合成模式</h2><p><code>globalAlpha</code>（0 到 1）给之后所有绘制叠加一层透明度，与 <code>fillStyle</code> 里颜色自带的 alpha 相乘。而 <code>globalCompositeOperation</code> 决定「新画的内容如何与画布上已有内容混合」——它远不止透明这么简单。默认是 <code>source-over</code>（新内容盖在旧内容上），但还有一整套 Porter-Duff 合成模式和混合模式：<code>lighter</code>（颜色相加，做发光/粒子叠加）、<code>multiply</code>（正片叠底，做阴影）、<code>destination-out</code>（用新形状挖掉旧内容，做橡皮擦）、<code>source-in</code>（只保留与新形状相交处，做蒙版）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"ctx.save();&#10;ctx.globalCompositeOperation = &#39;lighter&#39;; // 颜色相加，越叠越亮&#10;for (const p of particles) {&#10;  ctx.fillStyle = p.color;&#10;  ctx.beginPath();&#10;  ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, p.r, 0, Math.PI * 2);&#10;  ctx.fill();&#10;}&#10;ctx.restore(); // 务必还原，否则后续全部相加\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.globalCompositeOperation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lighter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 颜色相加，越叠越亮</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> particles) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.fillStyle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beginPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">arc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p.x, p.y, p.r, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Math.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">PI</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">restore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 务必还原，否则后续全部相加</span></span></code></pre></div><p>合成模式是实现橡皮擦、发光粒子、蒙版裁剪等效果的底层机关，威力大也危险——设了不还原会让后续绘制全部错乱，所以它几乎总要包在 save/restore 里。更细的二维绘图状态管理，兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../canvas-2d-graphics/foundations/canvas-api\">Canvas 2D 图形 · Canvas API</a> 有更完整的参考。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>getContext(&#39;2d&#39;)</code> 返回的是一台状态机，维护填充/描边/透明度/合成/变换/裁剪等当前状态；绘制指令读状态但不改状态，改状态的是赋值和变换调用。</li>\n<li><code>save</code>/<code>restore</code> 提供后进先出的状态栈，是避免状态污染的命脉；把每次临时改状态的绘制包成一个 save/restore 作用域是最稳健的默认习惯。</li>\n<li>当前路径<strong>不受</strong> save/restore 管理，清路径要靠 <code>beginPath()</code>——这是最常见的陷阱。</li>\n<li>变换通过左乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 齐次矩阵实现，累积且顺序敏感，必须配合 save/restore；<code>globalAlpha</code> 与 <code>globalCompositeOperation</code> 控制透明度与混合，合成模式威力大、务必及时还原。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"paths-shapes\">路径与形状</a> 讲被状态机忽略的「当前路径」如何构建；变换矩阵的同款数学在 <a href=\"../webgl/rendering-pipeline\">渲染管线</a> 里再次登场。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：更完整的二维绘图 API 参考见 <a href=\"../../canvas-2d-graphics/foundations/canvas-api\">Canvas 2D 图形 · Canvas API</a>；坐标变换的独立专题见 <a href=\"../../canvas-2d-graphics/foundations/coordinate-transforms\">Canvas 2D 图形 · 坐标变换</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"绘图上下文与状态机","id":"绘图上下文与状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一台带状态栈的绘图机器","id":"核心概念-一台带状态栈的绘图机器"},{"level":2,"text":"状态栈：save 与 restore 的正确姿势","id":"状态栈-save-与-restore-的正确姿势"},{"level":2,"text":"变换矩阵：坐标系是可以移动的","id":"变换矩阵-坐标系是可以移动的"},{"level":2,"text":"透明度与合成模式","id":"透明度与合成模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"API 谱系：Canvas 2D、WebGL 与 WebGPU","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/foundations/graphics-api-landscape"},"next":{"title":"路径与形状","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/canvas2d/paths-shapes"}}